          "id": "02-go-one-circle-in",
          "slug": "go-one-circle-in",
          "title": "Go one circle in",
          "summary": "The outer circle of marketing is shouting about whatever you already made. Inner circles are a story for a tribe, the experience around the product, and the product itself.",
