      "markdown": "# GACC card\n\nUse after lesson 09, before making anything longer than a short note.\n\nDate:\n\nWork this card is for (will not publish unless I later choose to):\n\n**Goal** (specific, observable, time-bound)\n\n**Audience** (who would care a lot)\n\n**Creative / unique take** (the point of view a competitor could not copy honestly)\n\n**Channel** (one place this piece will live)\n\nDoes this ladder up to a perception or a real goal? Yes / No\n\nDoes this add value for that audience, or is it a duplicate? Add / Duplicate\n",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"user-content-gacc-card\">GACC card</h1>\n<p>Use after lesson 09, before making anything longer than a short note.</p>\n<p>Date:</p>\n<p>Work this card is for (will not publish unless I later choose to):</p>\n<p><strong>Goal</strong> (specific, observable, time-bound)</p>\n<p><strong>Audience</strong> (who would care a lot)</p>\n<p><strong>Creative / unique take</strong> (the point of view a competitor could not copy honestly)</p>\n<p><strong>Channel</strong> (one place this piece will live)</p>\n<p>Does this ladder up to a perception or a real goal? Yes / No</p>\n<p>Does this add value for that audience, or is it a duplicate? Add / Duplicate</p>",
