      "lesson_id": "17-improve-what-already-ranks",
      "lesson_path": "content/lessons/17-improve-what-already-ranks.md",
      "kind": "method",
      "statement": "Title tests belong on pages already near the top that get impressions but few clicks. Write at least three titles with the searcher’s words first, a specific promise, a reason to click, under about 60 characters, and nothing the page does not deliver.",
