      "lesson_path": "content/lessons/19-be-listed-where-buyers-look.md",
      "kind": "method",
      "statement": "Treat directory and launch lists as places to investigate, not as 200 guaranteed backlinks. Some are free, some cost money, and many require a real qualifying product.",
