        "excerpt": "Emily Kramer / MKT1",
        "searchText": "How to create a more effective homepage Emily Kramer / MKT1 web-page A homepage that makes sense Ineffective homepages fail to say what the product does, who it is for, and why someone would choose it, which wastes every visit you worked to get. A homepage that makes sense Start with a short messaging guide of building blocks, then plan a simple layout, then turn those blocks into copy section by section. Messaging is intent; copy is the exact words. A homepage that makes sense An early B2B homepage can follow a simple sequence navigation, hero, social proof, two or three benefits with proof, optional use cases or personas, optional how it works, and a final call to action above the footer."
