        "excerpt": "DAN KOE (thedankoe)",
        "searchText": "The most lucrative AI business to start in 2027 DAN KOE thedankoe x-article Full text retrieved; some inline media/embedded demos not inspected. Figures are not silently reconstructed. Founder presence without becoming an influencer Capturing attention is valuable, and “founder-led marketing” often just means the founder posts. Most founders, Dan Koe writes, are bad at it. The one-person creative team path Whatever you build, capturing attention and acquiring customers sit near the center of whether it works. Other people will also pay for that skill. The one-person creative team path A one-person creative team combines brand strategy (positioning and what you will not chase), content strategy (what is working and what to make next), and drafting or publishing. The one-person creative team path Koe writes that $10 to $75 thousand a month for one to three clients is not far out of reach for someone good at this, and cites large creator-economy figures. Those are his claims and citations."
